\f0\b\fs24 \cf0 Blotter 1.2\

\b0 \
New date display option, multi display support, better international support and minor bug fixes.\
\
\'95 Weekday dates: optionally display the date of each weekday column. \
\'95 Pick display: for Macs with more than one display, you can now choose which one to use for Blotter.\
\'95 Resolves an issue with Blotter disappearing if used together with third party application Hyperspaces.\
\'95 Improves date formatting and localization when the system language is not English.\
\'95 Resolves an issue with the time column not fitting in the allotted space for some languages.\

\b \
Blotter 1.1\
\

\b0 New calendar picker feature, To Do sorting, and minor bug fixes. \
\
\'95 Pick calendars: Choose which calendars to display on the new Calendars preferences page. \
\'95 Sorted To Do: Tasks in the To Do list are now sorted by due date, then priority, putting the most urgent tasks on top. \
\'95 Shows the preferences page on first startup for a running start. \
\'95 Resolves an issue with very short events overlapping. \
\'95 Improves the display of event titles too long to fit in the available space.\
